```text
Distributions 
Solo provides two main distributions of Istio as follows.

Standard: A copy of the community Istio distribution. This distribution does not contain Solo.io’s enterprise features or extended Istio support. Example: 1.30.5
Solo: An enterprise distribution of the community Istio project with additional security patches, as well as certain Envoy filters to enable Solo Enterprise for Istio features, such as support for deploying Istio service meshes in ambient mode. You must use the solo image to use these features. Example: 1.30.5-solo

Both Solo’s standard and solo distributions of Istio come in the following optional varieties.

FIPS: An image that is tagged with fips complies with NIST FIPS, for use cases that require federal information processing capabilities. For more information, see About Solo FIPS distribution of Istio. Examples: 1.30.5-fips, 1.30.5-solo-fips
Distroless: An image that is tagged with distroless is a slimmed down distribution with the minimum set of binary dependencies to run the image, for enhanced performance and security. Note that if your app relies on package management, shell, or other operating system tools such as pip, apt, ls, grep, or bash, you must find another way to install these dependencies. Examples: 1.30.5-distroless, 1.30.5-solo-distroless



分布
Solo提供了Istio的两个主要发行版，如下所示。
标准：社区Istio发行版的副本。此发行版不包含Solo.io的企业功能或扩展的Istio支持。示例：1.30.5
Solo：社区Istio项目的企业版，带有额外的安全补丁，以及某些Envoy过滤器，用于启用Solo enterprise的Istio功能，例如支持在环境模式下部署Istio服务网格。您必须使用独奏图像才能使用这些功能。示例：1.30.5-solo

Solo的Istio标准版和独奏版都有以下可选版本。

FIPS：标记有FIPS的图像符合NIST FIPS，适用于需要联邦信息处理能力的用例。有关更多信息，请参阅Istio的Solo FIPS发行版。示例：1.30.5像素、1.30.5像素
Distrioles：标记为无发行版的映像是一种精简的发行版，具有运行映像的最小二进制依赖关系集，可提高性能和安全性。请注意，如果你的应用程序依赖于包管理、shell或其他操作系统工具，如pip、apt、ls、grep或bash，你必须找到另一种方法来安装这些依赖关系。示例：1.30.5无杆，1.30.5无色


```

